(41, N'TH-05-00041', N'Driftwood Gear Larch Lite Insulated Jacket', 5, N'Driftwood Gear', 279.99, 155.71, N'{"colors": ["Glacier Blue", "Sand", "Ember"], "weight_g": 1125, "sizes": ["XS", "S", "M", "L", "XL", "XXL"], "waterproof": false, "material": "recycled nylon"}', N'The Driftwood Gear Larch Lite Insulated Jacket is an insulated jacket built for family camping. Packable puffy for cold belays and winter camp evenings. Windproof ripstop face fabric. Synthetic fill stays warm when damp.', 1),
