(47, N'TH-11-00047', N'Driftwood Gear Switchback Lite Stove', 11, N'Driftwood Gear', 174.99, 77.10, N'{"colors": ["Slate", "Black"], "weight_g": 741}', N'The Driftwood Gear Switchback Lite Stove is a stove built for family camping. Integrated pot system packs everything together. Canister stove boils a liter of water in about three minutes. Windscreen improves efficiency in breezy conditions.', 1),
(48, N'TH-12-00048', N'Tidewater Cirque Pro Daypack', 12, N'Tidewater', 59.99, 33.80, N'{"colors": ["Glacier Blue", "Ember"], "weight_g": 1370, "capacity_l": 18, "waterproof": false}', N'The Tidewater Cirque Pro Daypack is a daypack built for family camping. Hydration sleeve and hose port. Rain cover tucked in the base pocket. Padded hip belt with zip pockets.', 1),
