(1, 127, 793, 5, N'Trail tested and loved', N'Used it all summer in the Alps. Great ankle support on rocky descents. Kept my feet completely dry crossing streams. Five stars from me.', '2026-08-06'),
(2, 147, 793, 4, N'Very good', N'Great purchase for our family camping trip. Comfortable straight out of the box. Dries quickly at the campsite. Only complaint: buckle broke on the second trip. Highly recommend.', '2026-08-15'),
(3, 167, 1138, 4, N'Great with minor quirks', N'Tested on the Kungsleden trail. Incredibly warm for its weight. Perfect layer for cold belays. Only complaint: lost loft after getting wet. Highly recommend.', '2026-08-07'),
(4, 74, 1119, 5, N'Excellent', N'Took it hiking in the Tatras. The rock plate saved my feet on sharp scree. Cushioning is great for long trail races. Would buy again.', '2026-08-10'),
