(6, 192, 1049, 4, N'Great with minor quirks', N'Bought it for a trip to Lapland. Comfortable on hot summer hikes. Hip belt pockets fit snacks and a phone. Only complaint: shoulder straps dig in with heavier loads. Five stars from me.', '2026-08-07'),
