(1430, 231, 981, 3, N'Okay', N'Disappointed with this one. Accurate tracking even in deep valleys, but the screen scratched easily.', '2026-09-04'),
(1431, 239, 1224, 4, N'Happy with it', N'Used this on a week in the mountains. Kept me warm at minus fifteen in the wind. Perfect layer for cold belays. Only complaint: down feathers leak through the seams. Worth every euro.', '2026-09-11'),
(1432, 19, 1036, 3, N'Does the job', N'Disappointed with this one. Broke in quickly with no blisters, but the sole began peeling after one season.', '2026-09-06'),
(1433, 126, 1036, 2, N'Disappointing', N'Expected better at this price. Flow rate is painfully slow. The pouch tore at the seam. Hoping the replacement is better.', '2026-09-05'),
(1434, 200, 1036, 4, N'Happy with it', N'Bought it for a trip to Lapland. Light and fast on muddy forest trails. Cushioning is great for long trail races. Only complaint: mesh tore near the toe after 200 km. Worth every euro.', '2026-09-09'),
(1435, 38, 653, 5, N'Exceeded expectations', N'Bought it for a trip to Lapland. Drains water quickly after river crossings. Cushioning is great for long trail races. Worth every euro.', '2026-09-05');
